# Design-system colors

Use public TrinketDesignSystem APIs for product colors. Follow the canonical
[color roles and exception policy](../../Packages/TrinketDesignSystem/Documentation/VisualRoles.md#color-families)
and [semantic modifiers](../../Packages/TrinketDesignSystem/Documentation/Modifiers.md).
The existing `check-ui-style.py` gate enforces color routing.
